  m_text: "<b>Characteristics:</b> Clayey texture, high moisture retention, rich
    in iron, lime, and alumina; develops cracks in dry season.\n<b>Location:</b>
    Deccan Plateau \u2013 Maharashtra, Madhya Pradesh, Gujarat, small parts of Andhra
    Pradesh and Tamil Nadu.\n<b>Also Known As:</b> Regur Soil / Cotton Soil."
