  m_text: '<b>Characteristics:</b> Loose, coarse texture; rich in humus in lower
    slopes, less fertile at higher altitudes.

    <b>Location:</b> Himalayan and
    hilly regions of Jammu & Kashmir, Himachal Pradesh, Uttarakhand, Sikkim, Arunachal
    Pradesh, North Bengal foothills, patches in Manipur and Mizoram.

    <b>Also
    Known As:</b> Hill Soil.'
