  m_text: '<b>Characteristics:</b> Fertile, fine-grained soil rich in potash and
    lime; ideal for agriculture. Found in newer (Khadar) and older (Bangar) forms.

    <b>Location:</b>
    Indo-Gangetic plains covering Punjab, Haryana, Uttar Pradesh, Bihar, West Bengal,
    and parts of Assam, Rajasthan, Gujarat.

    <b>Also Known As:</b> Riverine Soil.'
