  m_text: '<b>Characteristics:</b> Formed from crystalline and metamorphic rocks;
    poor in humus, phosphorus, and nitrogen.

    <b>Location:</b> Chhattisgarh,
    Odisha, southern Madhya Pradesh, Jharkhand, Karnataka, Eastern Andhra Pradesh.

    <b>Also
    Known As:</b> Southern and Eastern Plateau Soil.'
