  m_text: '<b>Characteristics:</b> Rich in iron and aluminium, low in humus; formed
    under high temperature and rainfall conditions. Supports plantation crops.

    <b>Location:</b>
    Western Ghats, small pockets of Odisha and patches in Assam hills.

    <b>Also
    Known As:</b> Brick Soil due to its hard crust when dry.'
